<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Nov 28.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Nov 28.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flights may be postponed at airports in Russia's central-Volga region and the Urals on November 29 due to thick fog, the Russian Weather Service said on Thursday. -- Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
